{"id": 981518, "slug": "heading-out", "name": "Heading Out", "name_original": "Heading Out", "description": "It's not about the destination, it's about the journey.<br/>Heading Out is an immersive driving game meets visual novel passionately inspired by cult classic road movies.<br/>Escape your fears by taking off down American highways on an emotional trip of discovery.<br/><br/><h3>KEY FEATURES</h3><strong>Your Adventure - What's your motivation?</strong><br/>The fears, dreams, ambitions and choices of your driver pave the road ahead so each run is a unique combination of races, chases, hazards and colorful characters.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Your Path - Will you, or won't you?</strong><br/>Each strategic decision impacts a variety of systems including who you meet along the way, what radio hosts say about you, fuel consumption, car condition and wanted level.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Your Legend - When and where does it end?</strong><br/>An eclectic Americana soundtrack backs each road trip playthrough as your experience expands across the unpredictable western frontier.<br/><br/>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-05-06", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-06-15T22:43:17", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/198/1989c8b82e56e420b007f207a44b192a.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/ae9/ae9c4865ca94569b3aea110d6c26252c.jpg", "website": "https://www.headingout.games/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 1, "ratings": [{"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 3, "percent": 60.0}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 20.0}, {"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 1, "percent": 20.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 33, "added_by_status": {"owned": 10, "beaten": 3, "toplay": 16, "dropped": 4}, "playtime": 5, "screenshots_count": 11, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 3, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "red