{"id": 146, "name": "Nonlinear", "slug": "nonlinear", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2509, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/326/326cbbdc3bc2da0b10cc3f7edd57161a.jpg"}, {"id": 583, "name": "Narrative", "slug": "narrative", "language": "eng", "games_count": 9146, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/384/3840fdbb91612c81db98176a4c1e7a8d.jpg"}, {"id": 275, "name": "Movie", "slug": "movie", "language": "eng", "games_count": 1073, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/858/8588039ed3ddb3eae2311c26a95d3980.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 7574, "name": "Crunching Koalas", "slug": "crunching-koalas", "games_count": 23, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/0b7/0b7574f4f9c3820c7db80d2560edf6af.jpg"}, {"id": 13070, "name": "Saber Interactive", "slug": "saber-interactive", "games_count": 20, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/102/1022433a11b73b5aac8d84342c47103c.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "It's not about the destination, it's about the journey.\nHeading Out is an immersive driving game meets visual novel passionately inspired by cult classic road movies.\nEscape your fears by taking off down American highways on an emotional trip of discovery.\nKEY FEATURESYour Adventure - What's your motivation?\nThe fears, dreams, ambitions and choices of your driver pave the road ahead so each run is a unique combination of races, chases, hazards and colorful characters.\nYour Path - Will you, or won't you?\nEach strategic decision impacts a variety of systems including who you meet along the way, what radio hosts say about you, fuel consumption, car condition and wanted level.\nYour Legend - When and where does it end?\nAn eclectic Americana soundtrack backs each road trip playthrough as your experience expands across the unpredictable western frontier."}